# Day 48/50 — Software Updates

That notification appears again --
"An update is available"

We often postpone it, ignore it or click 'Remind me later'

But software updates do more than change how an application looks.
They can fix bugs, improve performance, introduce new features and patch security vulnerabilities.

An update helps software adapt to changing needs and problems.
And it makes me think about something.

Staying the same might feel comfortable, but improvement sometimes requires changing what already exists.

Not every change is necessary, and not every update is perfect but refusing to improve can leave things behind.

**Because even something that works today may need an update tomorrow.**
